Purpose
This document defines the master relationship model for PropertyPilot.
It serves as the authoritative reference for:
Business Model
Operational Workflow
Database Design
JPA Entities
API Design
Frontend Screens
Future Enhancements

Core Design Principle
PropertyPilot is a:
Property-Centric Service Platform
NOT:
Marketplace
Classified Portal
Property Listing Website
Broker Platform

PropertyPilot revolves around:
Customer
    ↓
Property
    ↓
Services
    ↓
Subscriptions
    ↓
Leads
    ↓
Deals

