LEAD DOMAIN
Lead is NOT the final goal.
Lead is an opportunity.
Relationships
Lead
   │
   ├── Customer
   ├── Property
   ├── Services
   ├── Assessments
   ├── Activities
   └── Deal

Lead Lifecycle
Lead Created
      ↓
Qualified
      ↓
Assessment
      ↓
Required Services Identified
      ↓
Service Requests Generated
      ↓
Ready For Deal
      ↓
Converted

Important Business Rule
A lead may:
Generate Services
Generate Deal
Generate Both
Generate Neither

